{"seq":2,"slug":"directed-energy-weapons","title":"定向能武器","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/emerging-military-tech/directed-energy-weapons","wordCount":1449,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"定向能武器\">定向能武器</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>定向能武器（Directed Energy Weapons，DEW）利用高度聚焦的能量束（激光、微波或粒子束）以光速或近光速攻击目标。与传统动能武器相比，定向能武器具有打击速度为光速（无需提前量计算）、单次发射成本极低（美元级）、理论上「无限弹药」和可调节杀伤效果等独特优势。</p>\n<p>理解定向能武器的钥匙，是看清它的「成本不对称」革命：用几美元一发的能量束，去拦截几千美元的无人机和几百万美元的导弹，从根本上改写了防御方的经济账。但「无限弹药」是有前提的——电力、散热和恶劣天气是它真正的天花板。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    LASER[&quot;高能激光 HEL&lt;br/&gt;点打击·光速·受天气影响&quot;] --&gt; APP[&quot;反无人机/反火箭弹&quot;]&#10;    HPM[&quot;高功率微波 HPM&lt;br/&gt;面覆盖·烧电路&quot;] --&gt; SWARM[&quot;反蜂群&quot;]&#10;    PB[&quot;粒子束&lt;br/&gt;穿透·大气易发散&quot;] --&gt; RES[&quot;基础研究阶段&quot;]&#10;    APP --&gt; COST[&quot;成本不对称:美元 vs 百万美元&quot;]&#10;    SWARM --&gt; COST\">graph TD\n    LASER[\"高能激光 HEL&lt;br/&gt;点打击·光速·受天气影响\"] --&gt; APP[\"反无人机/反火箭弹\"]\n    HPM[\"高功率微波 HPM&lt;br/&gt;面覆盖·烧电路\"] --&gt; SWARM[\"反蜂群\"]\n    PB[\"粒子束&lt;br/&gt;穿透·大气易发散\"] --&gt; RES[\"基础研究阶段\"]\n    APP --&gt; COST[\"成本不对称:美元 vs 百万美元\"]\n    SWARM --&gt; COST</pre><h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"三类定向能武器对比\">三类定向能武器对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>作战方式</th>\n<th>成熟度</th>\n<th>主要局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高能激光 HEL</td>\n<td>点打击、烧蚀/熔穿</td>\n<td>已部署</td>\n<td>雨雾烟尘、热晕、散热</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高功率微波 HPM</td>\n<td>面覆盖、烧毁电路</td>\n<td>试装备</td>\n<td>需 GW 级峰值功率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粒子束</td>\n<td>穿透沉积能量</td>\n<td>基础研究</td>\n<td>大气中库仑散射发散</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"高能激光武器-最成熟的一支\">高能激光武器：最成熟的一支</h3><p>高能激光（HEL）将电能或化学能转化为高度相干的定向光束，在目标表面产生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">kW/cm^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 量级功率密度来烧蚀目标。激光在大气中传播随距离衰减为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(z) = P_0 \\cdot e^{-\\alpha z}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 为大气消光系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 为传播距离。清洁大气中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.06</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.06\\,\\mu m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.06</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 波长的消光系数约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>km</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1/\\text{km}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span></span></span></span></span>，但在雾、雨和烟尘中可增大数十倍——这是激光武器的「阿喀琉斯之踵」。热晕效应（激光加热空气改变折射率导致光束展宽）可用自适应光学部分克服。</p>\n<p>光纤激光器通过相干合束将数百根光纤输出合成一束，电光转换效率达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\text{–}40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span>。已部署/在研系统：美国 AN/SEQ-3 LaWS（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30kW</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，2014 年部署「庞塞」号）、洛克希德·马丁 HELIOS（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60kW</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>+，装于「普瑞布尔」号驱逐舰）、以色列「铁束」（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100kW</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 级，2024 年首次实战拦截火箭弹和无人机）、英国 DragonFire（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50kW</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 级，2024 年完成海上试射）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"高功率微波武器-反蜂群利器\">高功率微波武器：反蜂群利器</h3><p>高功率微波（HPM）发射高强度微波脉冲，通过「前门」（天线端口）或「后门」（缝隙耦合）进入电子设备，感应出超过器件耐压的瞬态电压使其烧毁。与激光的点打击不同，微波可同时覆盖一个区域内的所有电子设备，特别适合对抗 <a href=\"unmanned-combat-systems\">无人机蜂群</a>。有效辐射功率（ERP）通常需达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">GW</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 级。美国 AFRL 的 CHAMP 项目将 HPM 源装于巡航导弹，2012 年测试中使一栋建筑内所有电子设备失效；雷神 Phaser 是集装箱式反无人机微波武器。</p>\n<h3 id=\"粒子束武器与战术应用\">粒子束武器与战术应用</h3><p>粒子束武器将带电粒子加速到接近光速聚焦射向目标，穿透表面在内部沉积能量。但在大气中带电粒子束因库仑散射迅速发散，仍处于基础研究阶段。定向能武器最现实的近期应用：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>反无人机/反火箭弹</strong>：低单发成本（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{–}10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 美元/发）避免用百万美元防空导弹拦截千元无人机</li>\n<li><strong>助推段导弹防御</strong>：照射 <a href=\"../aerospace-military-tech/ballistic-missiles\">助推段弹道导弹</a> 薄壁蒙皮使其结构失效</li>\n<li><strong>卫星致盲/致损</strong>：地基激光照射 <a href=\"../aerospace-military-tech/military-satellites\">侦察卫星</a> 光学传感器</li>\n<li><strong>拦截高超声速武器</strong>：以光速拦截高机动目标（见 <a href=\"../aerospace-military-tech/hypersonic-weapons\">高超声速武器</a>）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2024–2026 年关键进展：以色列「铁束」在加沙冲突中首次实战，验证激光防空的实战可行性；美国陆军 IFPC-HEL（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300kW</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 级）推进工程研发，目标替代「爱国者」承担部分防空任务；英国和日本签署定向能合作协议；舰载激光从防御性反无人机向进攻性反舰艇发展；高功率微波反蜂群系统进入试装备阶段；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500kW</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 级激光器技术可行性已获验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>定向能武器的「无限弹药」优势在多大程度上是真实的？电力供应、散热和光学器件寿命如何限制实际作战持续性？</li>\n<li>激光武器在雨、雾、沙尘等恶劣天气下性能大幅下降，这一固有局限如何影响其战术可靠性？是否需要与动能武器混合编配？</li>\n<li>当激光防御系统能以极低成本拦截导弹和无人机时，进攻方会如何适应？是否会出现新的攻防不对称？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章姊妹篇：<a href=\"ai-autonomous-weapons\">AI与自主武器</a>（反蜂群的目标分配大脑）、<a href=\"unmanned-combat-systems\">无人作战系统</a>（定向能的主要拦截对象）。</li>\n<li>助推段拦截见 <a href=\"../aerospace-military-tech/ballistic-missiles\">弹道导弹与防御系统</a>；拦截高超声速目标见 <a href=\"../aerospace-military-tech/hypersonic-weapons\">高超声速武器</a>；舰载供电见 <a href=\"../weapon-systems/naval-weapon-systems\">海战武器装备</a>（综合电力系统）。</li>\n<li>本 hub 整体定位见 <a href=\"../\">军事技术学科简介</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>定向能武器正从科幻走向战场现实。高能激光技术最成熟，已在多国海军和陆军开始部署，以色列率先实现实战验证；高功率微波在反无人机蜂群领域展现独特价值；粒子束仍处基础研究阶段。定向能武器的光速打击、低成本和可持续性使其成为应对低成本非对称威胁的理想手段，但大气传播限制、电力需求和恶劣天气适应性仍是待解的工程挑战。抓住「成本不对称」这条主线，再看它与 <a href=\"unmanned-combat-systems\">无人蜂群</a> 的攻防博弈，便能理解定向能为何被寄予「破解廉价饱和攻击」的厚望。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"定向能武器","id":"定向能武器"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"三类定向能武器对比","id":"三类定向能武器对比"},{"level":3,"text":"高能激光武器：最成熟的一支","id":"高能激光武器-最成熟的一支"},{"level":3,"text":"高功率微波武器：反蜂群利器","id":"高功率微波武器-反蜂群利器"},{"level":3,"text":"粒子束武器与战术应用","id":"粒子束武器与战术应用"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"人工智能与自主武器","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/emerging-military-tech/ai-autonomous-weapons"},"next":{"title":"无人作战系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/emerging-military-tech/unmanned-combat-systems"}}